Medium-Term Scheduler

Manager

Hall full?
Move some people outside temporarily.
What Happens in Modern Systems?

In modern Windows, Linux, and macOS:

Short-Term Scheduler is heavily used.
Medium-Term Scheduler exists through swapping/paging mechanisms.
Long-Term Scheduler is less visible because process admission is largely automatic.

But in OS theory and interviews, you should still know all three.

